+- [Download RPM packages and dependencies for offline RHEL-family systems](docs/OFFLINE-RPM-DNF-YUM.md)
+- [Download DEB packages and dependencies for offline Debian or Ubuntu](docs/OFFLINE-APT-DEBIAN-UBUNTU.md)
+- [Build an offline pacman repository for Arch Linux or Artix Linux](docs/OFFLINE-PACMAN-ARCH.md)
+- [Download Linux packages on Windows for an air-gapped Linux system](docs/AIRGAP-WINDOWS-WORKSTATION.md)
+
+### Capability map
+
+| Need | Feathered output |
+| --- | --- |
+| Offline RPM packages with dependency closure | Native RPM/YUM/DNF repository |
+| Offline DEB packages with dependency closure | Native APT repository |
+| Offline Arch/Artix packages | Native pacman repository |
+| Complete upstream repository | Repository mirror |
+| Smaller repeat transfer | Differential bundle against a Feathered baseline |
+| Direct target consumption | Offline installer where the selected workflow supports it |
+| Internal repository staging | Standard repository content suitable for downstream infrastructure |
+
